.TH CI_STRERROR 3 "25 July 1998"
.SH NAME
ci_strerror \- Get the description of an ci library error code
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
#include <ci.h>

const char *ci_strerror(int \fIcode\fP)
.fi
.SH DESCRIPTION
The
.B ci_strerror
function gets the description of the ci library error code
.IR code ,
returning the result as a NUL-terminated C string.
.SH NOTES
This function is not compatible with ci, it takes a different set of
arguments.
